und ähnlichem unter Stress stand und zusätzlich auch eher weniger Lust an CS:GO hatte.<br>Dieser Schritt musste leider gemacht werden und ist wahrscheinlich besser für beide Parteien. Wir benötigen keine Leute, die sich hierher zwingen und nur das mindeste tun, um &quot;über Wasser&quot; zu bleiben.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Nichtsdestotrotz, hat aPex in seiner administrativen Zeit eine gute Arbeit abgeliefert. Dafür bedanken wir uns und wünschen dir viel Spaß und Erfolg im privaten Leben. Ich persönlich hoffe zudem noch, dass du weiterhin ein Teil der Community bleibst.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":63546,"threadID":4283,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1489529632,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1489530389,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1489531286,"value":1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1489595228,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>I liked <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1563-apex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@aPex.</a> a lot he was one of the most chillest admin ( Aka soundboard <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span> ) and I had good talks with him and the fun already with him, I find it sad that he leaves us that fast as he had a lot of potentials.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1563-apex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@aPex.</a> I hope you set the sail towards your desire and have a lot of success in Private life, I will miss you and I hope to talk to you again soon  <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span>  <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":63547,"threadID":4283,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1489529647,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":